@model PagedResult<ContactMessage>
@{ ViewData["Title"]="Support Tickets"; }
<div class="page-title-row"><div><span class="eyebrow">SUPPORT ADMIN</span><h1>Support Tickets</h1><p>Review and resolve messages submitted through the Contact page.</p></div></div><section class="content-panel"><div class="list-toolbar"><form method="get" class="search-box"><i class="bi bi-search"></i><input name="searchTerm" value="@Model.SearchTerm" placeholder="Search name, email or message"/><button>Search</button></form><span class="record-count">@Model.TotalItems tickets</span></div><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table hub-table mb-0"><thead><tr><th>Submitted</th><th>Contact</th><th>Message</th><th>Status</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody>@if(Model.Items.Count==0){<tr><td colspan="5" class="empty-row">No support tickets found.</td></tr>}@foreach(var ticket in Model.Items){<tr><td>@ticket.SubmittedAt.ToLocalTime().ToString("dd MMM yyyy HH:mm")</td><td><strong>@ticket.Name</strong><small>@ticket.Email</small></td><td class="message-cell">@ticket.Message</td><td>@if(ticket.IsResolved){<span class="availability available">Resolved</span>}else{<span class="availability borrowed">Open</span>}</td><td>@if(!ticket.IsResolved){<form asp-action="Resolve" asp-route-id="@ticket.ContactMessageId" method="post"><button class="btn btn-sm btn-success">Resolve</button></form>}</td></tr>}</tbody></table></div></section>
